```
bash
hacker@globbing~tab-completion-on-commands:~$ pwncollege-4023 
Correct! Here is your flag:
pwn.college{E-vF7oKhCU_Q6YkJGO_qg6Bq4Wo.0VN0EzNxwiM4ETOwIzW}
```

